Package: tuxindrive-server
Version: 0.26.13
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: TuxInDrive contributors <tpluharik@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-cryptography, python3-defusedxml, adduser, ca-certificates, openssh-client, openssh-server, rclone
Recommends: tor, obfs4proxy
Homepage: https://github.com/tpluharik/TuxInDrive
Description: Self-hosted encrypted coordination and headless synchronization server
 TuxInDrive Server provides independently enabled headless synchronization,
 peer hosting, opaque encrypted mailbox, rendezvous, object cache,
 collaboration delivery, allowlisted no-storage relay, signed update
 attestation, authenticated administration API, and read-only MCP roles.
 Remote binding requires TLS and every private API requires a bearer token.
